      "text": "[8:59PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nEbute-Ero/Apongbon is moving smoothly at this moment.\nEko Bridge inw Apongbon, CMS Bridge, Carter Bridge to Ebute-Ero Market, and Broad Street to Offin Canal Market are all clear. There's also good movement on the CMS Bridge to Ijora Olopa stretch. No impediments are reported, ensuring a smooth journey.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
