      "text": "[9:16PM] #IyanaIpaja #TrafficUpdate \n\nIyana Ipaja-Egbeda axis is moving swiftly. Routes like Alagutan to Iyana Ipaja Roundabout, Iyana Ipaja Bridge to Alaagba, and Mosalasi to Baruwa and Egbeda intersection are all clear with fast movement in both directions.\nLagos-Abeokuta Expressway from Pleasure to Goye is also experiencing smooth traffic flow in both directions. \nNo delays or impediments are reported, ensuring a smooth ride for motorists.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
